prep_fix_history:
Optionally harden run_genus_mc.tcl with an explicit, opt-in define mechanism before read_hdl, e.g.:
  - if {[info exists ::env(GENUS_DEFINES)] && $::env(GENUS_DEFINES) ne ""} { set defs [split $::env(GENUS_DEFINES)] ; read_hdl -sv -define $defs -f $FILELIST } else { read_hdl -sv -f $FILELIST }
  This preserves the prep rule of not guessing/enabling macros automatically.

